  clock: 2  # 603d
  nonce: 603d  # 603d
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/langs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: records R / record struct S / record Q emit no symbol and members are unprefixed (P, Helper, N), while a control class gets C, C.G, C.Helper2. Since WI-binap (557de9f190) a call in a record property/method body anchors on that member, so the item's own P => Helper() repro no longer anchors on the file. A record FIELD-initialiser call still does (file -> Helper), record fields are not emitted, and new R(..) emits no instantiates edge. MECHANISM: no extraction branch for record_declaration (incl. record struct) in _extract_symbols_from_file / _get_enclosing_class. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-volus,WI-kokad,WI-sisuv."  # 603d
